05)--------TableScan: t1 projection=[a, b, c]
06)--------Projection: CASE WHEN Boolean(false) THEN Int32(0) ELSE count(Int64(1)) END AS count(*), t1_dscan_2.t1_a
07)----------Inner Join(ComparisonJoin):  Filter: t1_dscan_2.t1_a IS NOT DISTINCT FROM t1_dscan_1.t1_a
08)------------Aggregate: groupBy=[[t1_dscan_2.t1_a]], aggr=[[]]
09)--------------Projection: t1_dscan_2.t1_a
10)----------------Inner Join(ComparisonJoin): tree_branch.t1_ref = t1_dscan_2.t1_a
11)------------------SubqueryAlias: tree_branch
12)--------------------Projection: t1_ref
13)----------------------Filter: parent_id IS NULL
14)------------------------Projection: parent_id, t1_ref
15)--------------------------RecursiveQuery: is_distinct=false
16)----------------------------Projection: t2.a, t2.b AS parent_id, t2.c AS t1_ref, Int64(1) AS level
17)------------------------------TableScan: t2
18)----------------------------Projection: t2.a, t2.b AS parent_id, tree_branch.t1_ref, tree_branch.level + Int64(1)
19)------------------------------Left Join(ComparisonJoin): tree_branch.parent_id = t2.a
20)--------------------------------TableScan: tree_branch
21)--------------------------------TableScan: t2
22)------------------SubqueryAlias: t1_dscan_2
